item.description:
This guide will instruct you on setting up a self-hosted Rallly site with ReadySet enabled for faster database queries.
Prerequisites ReadySet local build: See instuctions here Self-hosted Rallly site Procedure Connect your database to your Rallly application by editing your config.env file. Uncomment DATABASE_URL and set its value to the connection string of ReadySet: DATABASE_URL=&lt;your ReadySet connection string&gt;
Connect to your database psql in this case: $ psql -h &lt;hostname&gt; -p &lt;port&gt; -d &lt;database type&gt; -U &lt;username&gt;
